{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股走勢向下，成交繼續淡靜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">重磅股拖低大市，騰訊跌百分之1，滙控下試157元水平。金屬股普遍受壓，洛鉬跌百分之4，紫金礦業也跌百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T05:38:43.424589+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":69,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}